    "assistantText": "Done.\n\n**Goal:** start one executor in team mode on a single independent task, bind it to a shared task with an owner, then report its name, id, and status via `list_agents`.\n\n**What happened**\n- Created shared task `task-1` (\"Write team workflow notes\") via `team_task_create`, write scope `notes/`.\n- Started teammate `notes-writer` with `pstack_subagent` (`agent_preset: poteto-agent`, route magpie / workbuddy/deepseek-v4.1-flash), first line of kickoff pointing at `poteto-mode/worker.md`.\n- Bound ownership with `team_task_update` action `reassign`, owner `notes-writer` (revision 1 → 2).\n- The executor wrote [notes/team-workflow.md](notes/team-workflow.md) and completed the task (revision 3, status `completed`).\n\n**`list_agents` report**\n- name: `notes-writer`\n- id: `task-1` (shared task id; the teammate's own session id is not exposed by `list_agents` in this harness)\n- current status: `inactive` (work finished, agent no longer running)\n\nNote from the executor: it received the task already `in_progress` and owned, so its `claim` call was rejected as not ready. It proceeded as owner and completed the task.",
